;	EXAMPLE CONFIG.SYS FILE
;
;
;
;	WCH CH375 USB2ISA CARD CONFIG
LASTDRIVE=Z
DEVICE=C:\CH375\CH375DOS.SYS @260 #07
;	loads CH375DOS.SYS for IO 260h & IRQ 7
:	You may need to change that for your setup.
;	See https://www.toughdev.com/content/2018/04/usb-flash-drives-on-8-bit-isa-bus-using-ch375-isb-to-usb-adapter/ for details
